ok - the lane refuses to run under a Bash that is not stock 3.2.57
ok - --list delegates selection to the test runner's stock-bash lane
ok - --shard lists the runner's shard, with the retained regression in shard 1 only
ok - a malformed --shard, or one on the shard-independent pin listing, is refused
ok - the lane runs the runner's selection and pins under stock Bash despite a newer bash on PATH
ok - every shard gets every pin; the parse sweep and retained regression run in shard 1 only
ok - a shard count the runner refuses stops the lane before it runs anything
ok - a failing selected test fails the lane
ok - a parse failure under stock Bash fails the lane and names the file
